{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤與網球新星黃澤林分手  22歲生日飛巴黎療傷？  法國街頭展現時尚魅力\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6da14da69642838fcb4f4779ce8eee6/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_1__20.png\"/>\n<p>歌神陳奕迅（Eason）與徐濠縈的 22 歲女兒陳康堤（Constance） ，早前傳出與網球新星黃澤林（Coleman）拍拖，但戀情曝光僅半年便爆出情變。黃澤林日前在直播期間承認已分手：「完咗啦，係囉，冇嘢嘅。」 而陳康堤同日分享生活照，心情似乎未受影響 。</p>\n<h2>陳康堤情傷飛巴黎慶祝生日</h2>\n<p>陳康堤日前在 IG 分享在巴黎的生活照，看來過得相當愜意、多姿多彩。從照片中可見，陳康堤最近飛到法國巴黎，似乎是為了慶祝 22 歲生日，以及參加當地的時尚活動 。她與幾位朋友暢遊當地，不僅在巴黎鐵塔下留倩影，又盡情享受美食，更收到至少兩個生日蛋糕，看來慶祝活動不斷，深受朋友愛護。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅與徐濠縈育有一女陳康堤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3fd3e01863554fc344cc4e37d6577b0/2026-10/CONSTANCE_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅與老婆徐濠縈去年為女兒陳康堤慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c438eac16bd531bbbd625cb2ff28c65e/2025-10/Constance_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤自與黃澤林傳情變後，生活如常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/913dac5bafa668c9cc95c6930d5ae183/2026-10/constance_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤10月初慶祝22歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a284212d21bfb77ab469a7f18d1580d0/2026-10/CONSTANCE_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤最近到巴黎出席時尚品牌活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6cd806ea1e03fc9e670214b4e24ea03/2026-10/CONSTANCE_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤穿上品牌服飾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b74fc35c23a31b74587985cc3e0522e1/2026-10/CONSTANCE_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤出席時裝騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82fee15bf677b73f95c7c79146fb9116/2026-10/CONSTANCE_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤最近被爆與黃澤林分手，心情未見受影響。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a8093b0f983b1cee3ab69a882121bc1/2026-10/CONSTANCE_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c8221dd32e0d39f1187c8013a45d38f/2026-10/CONSTANCE_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤在IG分享生活日常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58f31875fe3e715ba65ed3a533c696a7/2026-10/CONSTANCE_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤在IG晒出多張友人照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26d940b64f8ff66bcc5f8c4790f49849/2026-10/CONSTANCE_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤到巴黎鐵塔下打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6201f583fb4d178ba4104f8a635a3e5d/2026-10/CONSTANCE_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤此行飲飲食食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f89ab4ff71248d5c77718a76e9769d4/2026-10/CONSTANCE_10__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤活潑好動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9754ebec440435e875e07624827d2bad/2026-10/CONSTANCE_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤完全看不出情傷的痕跡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6e6607124a571cba4e278e00a0e37b6/2026-10/CONSTANCE_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤笑得燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21138f223374added687918d4bc8d0ee/2026-10/CONSTANCE_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤有感而發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e81bf61771b4e3066d5d1d9c1f1cc58/2026-10/6493_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤6月賀黃澤林22歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39709696027b98a37f58fd3a1009d66f/2026-06/3_28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳奕迅女兒陳康堤6月首晒與黃澤林拍拖片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6191415d15a41700e7591df7c3a29627/2026-06/1_4_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤與黃澤林早前傳出疑似分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab96899fbf7397168f153956eaa723ac/2026-06/2_2_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤已於IG取消關注黃澤林。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac6976590a7a6a907ca4d5327a681c24/2026-09/1_8_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林同樣已Unfollow陳康堤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5499283d7c878af6ed14c4e30ffe76a7/2026-09/2_3_72.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳康堤無懼流言 發文自勉身心感到富足</h2>\n<p>在其中一張照片中，陳康堤在巴黎鐵塔的夜景前自拍，並寫下「heart and belly full in paris &lt;3 j'adore paris &lt;3333」，表示愛上巴黎，因身心靈都感到富足。其他的照片又見到陳康堤與朋友搞怪自拍、穿上時尚的服飾在街頭留影，展現其作為時尚寵兒的魅力。</p>\n<h2>陳康堤感情動向備受矚目</h2>\n<p>陳康堤此行除了出席時裝騷外，亦抽空與友人行街觀光。在陳康堤的臉上始終掛著燦爛的笑容，活力十足，完全看不出情傷的痕跡。自去年正式加入樂壇以來，陳康堤備受矚目 ，其感情生活亦同樣因頻頻傳出話題而引發大眾高度關注 。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林最近在名古屋亞運的網球男單比賽上，撃敗吳易昺成功奪金。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6acac982d2a1721004cef65fc4c88a10/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_10_31_39_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林為港隊取得亞運首面網球金牌。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc077d0510f2c2d0cfeae9260f048a09/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-03_at_11_37_50_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤雖然未有在黃澤林的IG點讚或留言祝賀，卻在其他與男方有關的帖文中按Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38e1d8c0a7509ece7d60c083b35bf35d/2026-10/constance_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤被發現在黃澤林的Fanpage按Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa4df28181e826118b86d84e13427c05/2026-10/constance_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤的IG帳號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50d5bf2a37ac73600a3ebdca79048d87/2026-10/constance_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤10月4日慶祝22歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e558ed72ca0b19964758b80f4884acb3/2026-10/constance_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤10月4日在IG貼出童年相，並留言：「Happy 22 BAO BAO 健康快樂做自己」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb68b33d3ea24d40d3ad88d62887afdd/2026-10/constance_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"香港網球一哥黃澤林出戰亞運取得佳績。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30c6908cd1dbbefe07c2cae6687cf52d/2026-05/a_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網球一哥黃澤林發文用陳奕迅歌曲，當時被指行「外父政策」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34abf0f732db7e6ecb9b46d37ee6666d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_9_29_22_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林6月6日慶祝22歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6aa2e382dca1f53b964ec8831afbc3be/2026-06/coleman_wong_1780741041_3913461145111281366_3318146344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林職業生涯與戀情樣受外界關注。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72d31c480f9f772451f0b224b1d7dc96/2026-06/coleman_wong_1780741041_3913461147845788191_3318146344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林近日於英國比賽中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f9d9dde488e1c699cde78a3d7afeb3a/2026-05/b_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤和陳奕迅早前曾飛到法國力撐黃澤林。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93c651d2a0a62b543d4c6f5d36c58c6e/2026-05/c_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤全力為對方打氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/648e0a01bef6499f7f634a9c295e1d8d/2026-05/d_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤開心得手舞足蹈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/025bc6910002aa5f1be698c54cb1b4dd/2026-05/e_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林贏波後，陳奕迅當時被指緊擁「未來女婿」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/489e593e15f45218c29f8036cd03fabe/2026-05/f_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林在海外比賽，當時陳康堤親身到場支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d90d7bb523d510702303e0f54140a8d/2026-05/coleman_wong_1779454412_3902666665747565902_3318146344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林在IG分享比賽照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70c38e3c744f07aa2fa7f7b29ee04557/2026-05/coleman_wong_1779454412_3902666669229017468_3318146344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林罕有分享與陳康堤合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6a078721f9be0b155937eb30b9d8657/2026-05/coleman_wong_1779454412_3902666679731408491_3318146344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳康堤爸爸陳奕迅跟黃澤林認識。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/02a4d6417a7cdec78c2957895b2c5ea0/2026-04/ENP01P18210226.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:18:58.128950+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":592,"images":43,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T19:17:55.604892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:36.721625+00:00","content_hash":"5d1ff5fd72cfa32e89ec6ab9366f04164caead8ae6da77dc5836875ad3f27a5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}